WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.260
Now I'd like you to implement levels for your cat.

00:00:03.260 --> 00:00:07.050
Let's say that new cats have a level of newborn cat.

00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:10.490
After ten clicks, they get up to infant.

00:00:10.490 --> 00:00:14.938
Go ahead and use computed observables to add cat levels to your application.

00:00:14.938 --> 00:00:19.380
Now remember, you'll also need to add something to your HTML so you can show it.

00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:20.670
Hey, I'm a pretty fast clicker.

00:00:20.670 --> 00:00:22.926
I already got up to 110 here.

00:00:22.926 --> 00:00:23.890
Can you do better?

